extern wgf_vec3_normalize;

/// Returns the vector from `a` (at `t` = 0) to `b` (at `t` = 1). A `t` outside 0..1 extrapolates.
extern wgf_vec3_lerp;

/// Returns the cross product of `a` and `b`. It is right-handed: x cross y is z.
